From 1abae7a3652537cedc37d45348429018e360617c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWCH Phase 6 <phase6@openwch.local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 14:32:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] riscv: regenerate t-elf-multilib from the WCH
 GCC_MULTILIB list

Phenomenon: the official WCH 8.2.0 toolchain reports 23 multilib rows in
-print-multi-lib (evidence: tmp/toolchain_8.2.0/evidence/s1/multilib.txt,
sha256 99c32c5c...), including the three XW libraries rv32ecxw/ilp32e,
rv32imacxw/ilp32 and rv32imafcxw/ilp32f, while the stock v8.2.0-3.1 tree
carries the SiFive 7-token default table.

Spec source: WCH ships its build configuration in the distributed package;
ref/gcc/darwin-arm64/8.2.0/distro-info/scripts/common-versions-source.sh
pins GCC_MULTILIB to the 22-token list reproduced in the header comment of
this file.  The table is the output of the upstream multilib-generator run
over exactly that list (the framework regenerates t-elf-multilib whenever
GCC_MULTILIB is set; xPack v10.2.0-1.2 common-functions-source.sh).

Note: generated here with python3; the WCH build machine ran the generator
under python 2.  Equivalence is validated downstream by comparing our built
gcc -print-multi-lib byte-for-byte against the official 23-line table.

This is build infrastructure, not target-ISA behavior (phase-4 S2
precedent); listed separately in the phase-6 checklist.
---
 gcc/config/riscv/t-elf-multilib | 59 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 53 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gcc/config/riscv/t-elf-multilib b/gcc/config/riscv/t-elf-multilib
index 19f943461..0737a6e7e 100644
--- a/gcc/config/riscv/t-elf-multilib
+++ b/gcc/config/riscv/t-elf-multilib
@@ -1,30 +1,77 @@
 # This file was generated by multilib-generator with the command:
-#  ./multilib-generator rv32i-ilp32--c rv32im-ilp32--c rv32iac-ilp32-- rv32imac-ilp32-- rv32imafc-ilp32f-rv32imafdc- rv64imac-lp64-- rv64imafdc-lp64d--
-MULTILIB_OPTIONS = march=rv32i/march=rv32ic/march=rv32im/march=rv32imc/march=rv32iac/march=rv32imac/march=rv32imafc/march=rv32imafdc/march=rv32gc/march=rv64imac/march=rv64imafdc/march=rv64gc mabi=ilp32/mabi=ilp32f/mabi=lp64/mabi=lp64d
-MULTILIB_DIRNAMES = rv32i \
